ging and Artificial Intelligence-Enabled Food Image Recognition in Apps for Nutrition Care#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)":[35,37],"#Evaluating the Quality and Comparative Validity of Manual Food Logging and Artificial Intelligence-Enabled Food Image Recognition in Apps for Nutrition Care#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)#{1}":[36,37],"#Evaluating the Quality and Comparative Validity of Manual Food Logging and Artificial Intelligence-Enabled Food Image Recognition in Apps for Nutrition Care#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)":[38,40],"#Evaluating the Quality and Comparative Validity of Manual Food Logging and Artificial Intelligence-Enabled Food Image Recognition in Apps for Nutrition Care#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)":[41,42]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Görüntüle","target":"zotero://select/library/items/8B5II4RM","line":22},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/34WJJ22W?page=1&annotation=SYH4MSIB","line":33},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/34WJJ22W?page=1&annotation=N46EV4J7","line":36}],"metadata":{"Title":"Evaluating the Quality and Comparative Validity of Manual Food Logging and Artificial Intelligence-Enabled Food Image Recognition in Apps for Nutrition Care","Authors":"Xinyi Li, Annabelle Yin, Ha Young Choi, Virginia Chan, Margaret Allman-Farinelli, Juliana Chen","Year":2024,"DOI":"10.3390/nu16152573","Nitelik":null,"Alan":null,"Konu":null,"AI_Methodology":null,"Layer_Focus":null,"Model_Asamasi":null,"Proposed_Tool":null,"Methods":"AI. The top 200 free and paid nutrition-related apps from Australia’s Apple App and Google Play stores were screened (n = 800). Apps were assessed using MARS (quality) and ABACUS (behaviour change potential). Nutritional outputs from manual food logging and AI-enabled food-image recognition apps were compared with food records for Western, Asian, and Recommended diets.","Findings":"Apps with more AI integration demonstrated better functionality, but automatic energy estimations from AI-enabled food image recognition were inaccurate.","Conclusions":"","Limitations":"","User_Notes":""},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"1auowuz","at":1774939752735},"key":"Augmented Dietitian/liEvaluatingQualityComparative2024b.md"},
